.SH NAME
gyro-mail-migration-run - POST sync-jobs:run (GyroMail)


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro mail migration run   [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
POST sync-jobs:run (GyroMail)

.PP
Typed shortcut of the generic bridge: tool \fBsync-jobs\fR, action \fBrun\fR\&. Body fields are the tool's own fields. Needs \fB"confirm": true\fR\&.

.PP
API: POST /cloud/mail/{id}/migrations/{jid}/run (operationId typed_post_mail\fBid\fPmigrations\fBjid\fPrun, scope services_write)


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--data\fP=""
	request body as JSON, @file or @- (stdin)

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	show the price quote / request without changing anything

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for run

.PP
\fB--idempotency-key\fP=""
